WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.002
-Congratulations. Three seasons
now of "The Detour."

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.436
You play a federal agent.
Maybe not a great one?

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. She's probably not good
at her job.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I think that's
pretty accurate.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but that's kind of
status quo.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
That seems appropriate
right now.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.376 line:92%
-Yeah. It's a very funny show.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:11.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it hard to keep it together
when you're doing scenes

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:12.579 line:92%
like that with Jason Jones?

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.416
-Yeah. They wrote that scene,
like, the day before and then,

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:19.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
he and I did some, you know,
riffing, as it were.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, sure.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As you know,
he's a really funny guy.

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:22.555 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-He's really funny.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I had to eat a lot
in that scene,

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.527 line:92%
like a lot and drink a lot, too.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.328 line:92%
Not alcohol, unfortunately.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there was one point where
he made me laugh so hard

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.065 line:92%
that I actually did a spit take,

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I've never been able
to do.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, congrats.
-Yeah, thank you.

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:36.169 line:92%
-That's really something.

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:37.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I didn't mean to.
-Sure.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.206
-And they actually tried to use
it, but it was not appropriate.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:40.807 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I think, yeah.

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.976
It would probably look a little
bit like drooling, maybe.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:44.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
A spit take that happens
naturally

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:45.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
doesn't look the way
you picture.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It looks pretty beautiful.
It's gorgeous. Yeah.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, you have --
Your daughter is one?

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just turned one.
-She's 13 months.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.887
I know that's so annoying, but
the month makes a difference.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:54.587 line:92%
-I talk about it as well.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
I definitely do months.
-You have to.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel like
he's about to turn two,

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:58.892 line:92%
and I feel that's when it stops.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
-After that, then you're done.
-No one says 29 months.

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:02.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Some people do,
but we don't like them.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:06.099
-Yeah, those people, I have
no time for them in my life.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:06.599 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are there things --
Obviously now at 13 months,

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
there are things she's into,
things she's not into.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.104 size:78% position:39% line:92%
What is she not into?

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:14.240
-She's not into, right now,
sleeping through the night.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's not her jam.
-That's a drag.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.645
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
But she's a very decisive baby.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:21.648
Like, my friends joke that she's
actually not a baby.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's a C.E.O.
She's like a tiny C.E.O.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:24.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She's a single mom.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:27.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's working hard.
She works full time.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.088 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But we live in Harlem,

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she's like the mayor of
our four-block radius.

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:33.993
She walks down the street and
people are like, "Hi, Ella."

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she goes, "Hey!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:37.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's literally 13 --
a year old.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.632 size:81% position:41%
But if she likes you,
she'll come up to you,

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.502
whether she knows you or not
and goes...to give you a kiss.

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:45.638
But then, if she doesn't like
you and a grown-up is like,

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:48.308 size:78% position:39%
"Oh, you're so cute,"
she goes, "No-no."

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:48.842 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:51.144 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I'm like, "Oh, no, she's
just kidding." She's not.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:53.346 size:75% position:38%
-You did not grow up
in the city, right?

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I actually was born
in the city.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.149 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, gotcha.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, I grew up
in New Jersey

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then came back
when I was 18.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:01.688 size:84% position:42%
-Because I grew up in
the suburbs, and, like,

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.557
having a New York kid is
such an interesting thing.

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:07.293
They are interacting with people
so much more.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
Has New York as a parent
changed for you?

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:10.597 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Actually, yes.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's become a friendlier,
smaller town for me

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
because when it was just me,
I would sort of, like,

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:18.404 size:75% position:38%
walk down the street
with my blinders on

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.239 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and not look at anyone.

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:21.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, having this adorable
little person

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:22.542 size:81% position:41% line:92%
who is walking around,

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
people always want to stop
and talk to us.

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:26.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it's a much friendlier
environment.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.915 size:84% position:42%
There's a coffee shop
we go to every morning.

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:29.916 line:92%
And she is a regular there.

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's like the Norm of
this coffee shop.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
When she walks in,
everyone says her name.

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:34.954 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And for her birthday,

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.790
they played "Single Ladies,"
which is her favorite song.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:41.327
-And we put her on the table and
she danced to "Single Ladies."

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.997
All the baristas came out
from behind the counter,

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.231 line:92%
and all the locals were there.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were all dancing to
"Single Ladies."

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:49.636
And this one guy came in,
not a local, and started, like,

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:51.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
complaining, like he wanted
his coffee,

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
and our favorite barista,
Mariah, goes,

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, then, you can leave."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:57.911 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That is fantastic.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:00.213
-And I was like, that's what
growing up in New York is.

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:03.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
-True story. I've talked about
this on the show before.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Single Ladies,"
also my son's favorite song.

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:05.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.454
-It turns out we each had
multiple iPhone videos of

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
our children dancing to
"Single Ladies."

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So here -- They've never met.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's Ella and Ash dancing to
"single Ladies,"

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
two separate videos.
-Can't wait.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ -Oh, oh, oh,
oh, oh, oh ♪♪

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:19.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ Oh, oh, oh,
oh, oh, oh ♪♪

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:22.502
♪♪ If you like it then you should
have put a ring on it ♪♪

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:24.971
♪♪ if you like it, then you
should have put a ring on it ♪♪

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:25.505 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God.

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:28.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have to say, she's half his
age and twice as good.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:29.075 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:30.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
-His footwork.
-His footwork.

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:32.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He had, like, tango footwork
going on.

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.480 line:92%
He had very intricate footwork.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.148 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Intricate footwork.

00:03:35.148 --> 00:03:37.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like the footwork of
a very drunk man.

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:38.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:41.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Start trying to get into
a fight, you know.

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:41.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:44.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
But she also had
the very drunk man, like,

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:47.560
"I'm just gonna stand there and
like pulse my arms in the air."

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.294 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Well, she got the --

00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:50.096
he does this every now and then,
which is very exciting.

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.831
-The first time I ever played it
for her,

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:52.665 line:92%
I did not push Beyoncé on her.

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I love Beyoncé
because I'm a human person

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:55.702 size:88% position:44% line:92%
who lives on the planet.

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:56.436 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Yeah, of course. Yeah.

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:58.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I wasn't playing it
over and over again.

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:59.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first time
when Beyoncé said,

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:01.608 size:75% position:38%
"Put your hands up,"
my daughter went...

00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:02.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:03.509 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Five months old.

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:05.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Children -- they love
instruction.

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
They love instruction.
-From Beyoncé.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, exactly.
-Only from Beyoncé.

00:04:08.815 --> 00:04:10.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But he very seriously
will ask for it.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:13.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, he'll very earnestly go,
"Oh-oh song?"

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.621 line:92%
And I think that's pretty good.

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:16.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience awws ]
-Yeah.

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:16.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I want to ask.

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:19.058
You do something very wonderful
with Stephen Colbert.

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:21.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
You play the First Lady,
Melania Trump.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:24.264
-You have done it six times now.
-Yeah.

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:28.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you ever, obviously,
you wanted to be a performer.

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:30.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could not have imagined
many things

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.105 line:92%
that have happened to you.

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:32.772 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. None of it.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:34.374 size:81% position:41%
-But could you imagine
and ever conceive of

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:36.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
playing the First Lady
on a late night talk show?

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:38.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you surprised
that this has happened?

00:04:38.978 --> 00:04:39.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am shocked.
-Yeah.

00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:42.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am shocked that I would be
playing the First Lady

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:43.983
of the United States of America
on a talk show.

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:47.353
I don't think anyone could have
seen it coming, mostly her.

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:48.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:50.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you enjoy doing it?
-I do. I do enjoy doing it.

00:04:50.356 --> 00:04:51.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
I try not to make fun of her.
-Yeah.

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:54.994
-You know I try to use her as
a conduit to make fun of him.

00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:56.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I kind of see her as
America.

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:59.065
We're all reluctantly married to
Donald Trump now.

00:04:59.065 --> 00:04:59.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:02.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just making the best of it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:04.737 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And it turns out --

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:07.807
Yeah, like basically
the Constitution is our prenup.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:11.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're like, how do we -- and
we're just stuck with it.

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:12.211 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
All right, great.

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:15.715
Your mother was a performer
as well and a voice teacher.

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:16.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that accurate?
-Yes.

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:20.353
-And you convinced her to go out
and do some shows together.

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:22.155
-Yeah, both my parents actually
were performers.

00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:25.258
And then when I was, like,
2 years old, they got divorced.

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:26.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm fine.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:27.160 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And my mom remarried.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
My dad Sal --
we moved to New Jersey

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:30.263 line:92%
and she never performed again.

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:32.732
She has an amazing voice studio
in New Jersey.

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
And right after
I had my daughter,

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
about three months after I had
my daughter,

00:05:36.402 --> 00:05:39.272
I asked my mom if she would come
do concerts with me.

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
So 36 years after
being an actress,

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:44.510 size:78% position:39%
she finally came back
on the stage with me.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:46.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is so cool.
-It's so cool. It's so fun.

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:49.882
-That's really wonderful you
guys are doing that together.

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:51.084 line:92%
-I'm so grateful to her because

00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:53.653 size:81% position:41%
she gave up performing
to raise me in a way

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:54.754 line:92%
that was meaningful to her,

00:05:54.754 --> 00:05:57.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
raise me and my sister
Mary Ellen.

00:05:57.123 --> 00:05:59.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
The fact that I get to sort of
give it back to her

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:00.660 line:92%
is really meaningful to me

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
because she should have never
given it up.

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:04.430
-Well, that's very kind you gave
it back to her.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.200
-Please. She gave me a life.
-There you go. That's true.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
You haven't done enough!
[ Laughter ]

00:06:08.468 --> 00:06:11.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much for being
here. Just lovely to meet you.

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:13.272 line:92%
-Thank you for having me.

